* LTC6078 Unity-Gain Voltage Follower (Single 5 V Supply)
* 1 kHz, 100 mVp sine input, 10 k load
* Primary input node: IN     Primary output node: OUT

.lib LTC6078.sub

* ---------------- Supplies ----------------
VCC   VCC   0   DC 5
* Mid-supply reference for single-supply operation
VBIAS VMID  0   DC 2.5

* ---------------- Input source ----------------
* 1 kHz, 100 mV amplitude sine centered on mid-supply (2.5 V)
VIN   IN    VMID  SINE(0 0.1 1k 0 0 0) AC 1

* ---------------- LTC6078 unity-gain buffer ----------------
* Pin order: In+  In-  V+  V-  Out
XU1   IN   OUT   VCC   0   OUT   LTC6078

* ---------------- Load ----------------
RL    OUT  0     10k

* ---------------- Analysis ----------------
* 5 ms = 5 cycles at 1 kHz; skips no data so gain can be measured
.tran 0 5m 0 1u
* Alternative small-signal check (enable instead of .tran if desired):
* .ac dec 100 10 10Meg

.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7

.meas TRAN vin_pp  PP V(IN)  FROM 1m TO 5m
.meas TRAN vout_pp PP V(OUT) FROM 1m TO 5m
.meas TRAN gain_db PARAM 20*log10(vout_pp/vin_pp)

.end
